From 2ee14cdfb1e5153022ed4cf0c775f753471dc82d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tao Xiaobai <1599170798@qq.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 15:41:54 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] Little Craft Launcher: a preparation ends only when its
 asynchronous tasks have

Component unpacking queued its work on the executor and returned, so the
preparation could be reported cancelled or failed, and a retry accepted, while
the old task was still deleting and copying the shared component directories.

- AsyncAssetManager: synchronous unpackComponentsNow / unpackSingleFilesNow
  (the asynchronous entry points delegate to them and now always clear their
  progress). The entry activity uses them, so that work is inside the
  preparation's own call.
- LclPreparation takes a Settle that blocks until nothing the work started is
  still running; it is awaited on every path before the exclusive lock is
  released and before any final state is reported. The entry activity waits
  for the runtime's progress keeper to be idle.
- Regressions: outer work exited (cancelled / failed / succeeded) while an
  asynchronous child still writes, leave, retry at once.
