  *
  * - Preparations share files (the Java runtime archive and directory, library
  *   downloads), so only one runs in the process at a time.
+ * - The work may have started asynchronous tasks that outlive its own call
+ *   (anything the runtime runs on its executor). The preparation is only over
+ *   when those have ended too: {@link Settle} waits for them on every path,
+ *   success, failure and cancellation alike.
